<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1175] Entries are not removed from GridDhtLocalPartition after IgniteCache.remove</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1175</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For transactional cache entries are not removed from &lt;tt&gt;GridDhtLocalPartition.map&lt;/tt&gt; and are not added to remove queue (methods &lt;tt&gt;onDeferredDelete&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;onRemoved&lt;/tt&gt; are not called from &lt;tt&gt;IgniteCache.remove&lt;/tt&gt; method).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See &lt;tt&gt;CacheDhtLocalPartitionAfterRemoveSelfTest&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
